OL,3,GNEWSAHomes evacuated during Ballymena
OL,4,Asecurity alert
OL,5,
OL,6,FResidents have been evacuated from two
OL,7,Fhomes in an ongoing security alert in
OL,8,FBallymena, County Antrim.
OL,10,FPolice are at the scene in the
OL,11,FMoorfields Road area of the town.
OL,13,FCordons are in place, and members of
OL,14,Fthe public, including road users, are
OL,15,Fbeing advised to avoid the area.
OL,17,FPolice said an update will be provided
OL,18,Fsoon.
OL,23,APub: 13-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
